 "body": "Updates the requirements on [selenium](https://github.com/SeleniumHQ/Selenium) to permit the latest version.\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a href=\"https://github.com/SeleniumHQ/Selenium/releases\">selenium's releases</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>Selenium 4.53.0</h2>\n<h2>Detailed Changelogs by Component</h2>\n<p><!-- raw HTML omitted --> <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/SeleniumHQ/selenium/blob/trunk/java/CHANGELOG\">Java</a></strong>     |    <!-- raw HTML omitted --> <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/SeleniumHQ/selenium/blob/trunk/py/CHANGES\">Python</a></strong>     |    <!-- raw HTML omitted --> <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/SeleniumHQ/selenium/blob/trunk/dotnet/CHANGELOG\">DotNet</a></strong>     |    <!-- raw HTML omitted --> <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/SeleniumHQ/selenium/blob/trunk/rb/CHANGES\">Ruby</a></strong>     |    <!-- raw HTML omitted --> <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/SeleniumHQ/selenium/blob/trunk/javascript/selenium-webdriver/CHANGES.md\">JavaScript</a></strong>\n<!-- raw HTML omitted --></p>\n<!-- raw HTML omitted -->\n<h2>What's Changed</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>[rb] download the Server jar with Selenium Manager instead of the GitHub API by <a href=\"https://github.com/titusfortner\"><code>@​titusfortner</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/SeleniumHQ/selenium/pull/18245\">SeleniumHQ/selenium#18245</a></li>\n<li>[java] Escape quotes and backslashes in name locators sent to the driver by <a href=\"https://github.com/Mochxd\"><code>@​Mochxd</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/SeleniumHQ/selenium/pull/18151\">SeleniumHQ/selenium#18151</a></li>\n<li>[dotnet] [test] Unify assembly names for testing by <a href=\"https://github.com/nvborisenko\"><code>@​nvborisenko</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/SeleniumHQ/selenium/pull/18261\">SeleniumHQ/selenium#18261</a></li>\n<li>[rb] Allocate websocket command ids atomically by <a href=\"https://github.com/AutomatedTester\"><code>@​AutomatedTester</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/SeleniumHQ/selenium/pull/18262\">SeleniumHQ/selenium#18262</a></li>\n<li>[py] Add WebDriver cookie type annotations by <a href=\"https://github.com/adamtheturtle\"><code>@​adamtheturtle</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/SeleniumHQ/selenium/pull/17537\">SeleniumHQ/selenium#17537</a></li>\n<li>[py] Deprecate driver.webextension by <a href=\"https://github.com/AutomatedTester\"><code>@​AutomatedTester</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/SeleniumHQ/selenium/pull/18265\">SeleniumHQ/selenium#18265</a></li>\n<li>[py] Return a protocol-neutral driver.script by <a href=\"https://github.com/AutomatedTester\"><code>@​AutomatedTester</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/SeleniumHQ/selenium/pull/18264\">SeleniumHQ/selenium#18264</a></li>\n<li>[build] run the Redis-backed Grid suites from the Java smoke matrix instead of a separate workflow by <a href=\"https://github.com/titusfortner\"><code>@​titusfortner</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/SeleniumHQ/selenium/pull/18267\">SeleniumHQ/selenium#18267</a></li>\n<li>fix(<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/SeleniumHQ/Selenium/issues/18263\">#18263</a>): keep Selenium Manager stderr empty in --output json by <a href=\"https://github.com/macoladik\"><code>@​macoladik</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/SeleniumHQ/selenium/pull/18268\">SeleniumHQ/selenium#18268</a></li>\n<li>[js] hold BiDi numbers to their declared ranges by <a href=\"https://github.com/saiyam-jain-dev\"><code>@​saiyam-jain-dev</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/SeleniumHQ/selenium/pull/18272\">SeleniumHQ/selenium#18272</a></li>\n<li>[build] Add weekly CI check for Plausible pageview usage by <a href=\"https://github.com/titusfortner\"><code>@​titusfortner</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/SeleniumHQ/selenium/pull/17900\">SeleniumHQ/selenium#17900</a></li>\n<li>[java] hold generated BiDi numbers to their declared ranges by <a href=\"https://github.com/yashp676\"><code>@​yashp676</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/SeleniumHQ/selenium/pull/18266\">SeleniumHQ/selenium#18266</a></li>\n<li>[build] use the EngFlow cache for the Java GHA smoke test job by <a href=\"https://github.com/titusfortner\"><code>@​titusfortner</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/SeleniumHQ/selenium/pull/18276\">SeleniumHQ/selenium#18276</a></li>\n<li>[py] Support relative locators from WebElement and ShadowRoot by <a href=\"https://github.com/gjreddy\"><code>@​gjreddy</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/SeleniumHQ/selenium/pull/18241\">SeleniumHQ/selenium#18241</a></li>\n<li>[js][py][rb][java][dotnet] add the accessibility snapshot atom and the binding methods by <a href=\"https://github.com/AutomatedTester\"><code>@​AutomatedTester</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/SeleniumHQ/selenium/pull/18232\">SeleniumHQ/selenium#18232</a></li>\n<li>[grid] Spread new sessions across Nodes again by <a href=\"https://github.com/diemol\"><code>@​diemol</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/SeleniumHQ/selenium/pull/18281\">SeleniumHQ/selenium#18281</a></li>\n<li>[js] Add <code>@​selenium/mcp</code>, an MCP server for coding agents (v0) by <a href=\"https://github.com/AutomatedTester\"><code>@​AutomatedTester</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/SeleniumHQ/selenium/pull/18280\">SeleniumHQ/selenium#18280</a></li>\n<li>[js] MCP v1: drag, file upload, resize, network requests, evaluate by <a href=\"https://github.com/AutomatedTester\"><code>@​AutomatedTester</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/SeleniumHQ/selenium/pull/18284\">SeleniumHQ/selenium#18284</a></li>\n<li>[rust] Fix Firefox and Electron download URLs on Windows arm64 by <a href=\"https://github.com/dennisameling\"><code>@​dennisameling</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/SeleniumHQ/selenium/pull/18285\">SeleniumHQ/selenium#18285</a></li>\n<li>[java] Escape frame ids that are not valid CSS identifiers by <a href=\"https://github.com/Mochxd\"><code>@​Mochxd</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/SeleniumHQ/selenium/pull/18274\">SeleniumHQ/selenium#18274</a></li>\n<li>[py][rb][js] Fix tests failing in the nightly CI run by <a href=\"https://github.com/diemol\"><code>@​diemol</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/SeleniumHQ/selenium/pull/18289\">SeleniumHQ/selenium#18289</a></li>\n<li>[js] Move selenium-mcp to the SeleniumHQ/mcp repo by <a href=\"https://github.com/AutomatedTester\"><code>@​AutomatedTester</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/SeleniumHQ/selenium/pull/18290\">SeleniumHQ/selenium#18290</a></li>\n<li>[java] Log remote-client diagnostics at a fixed FINE level by <a href=\"https://github.com/MohabMohie\"><code>@​MohabMohie</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/SeleniumHQ/selenium/pull/18254\">SeleniumHQ/selenium#18254</a></li>\n<li>[rb] Allow to set environment variables when staring a browser by <a href=\"https://github.com/y-yagi\"><code>@​y-yagi</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/SeleniumHQ/selenium/pull/17395\">SeleniumHQ/selenium#17395</a></li>\n<li>[py][rb] Fix tests failing after the browser version update by <a href=\"https://github.com/diemol\"><code>@​diemol</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/SeleniumHQ/selenium/pull/18294\">SeleniumHQ/selenium#18294</a></li>\n<li>[js] Publish <code>@​selenium/manager</code> in releases by <a href=\"https://github.com/AutomatedTester\"><code>@​AutomatedTester</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/SeleniumHQ/selenium/pull/18296\">SeleniumHQ/selenium#18296</a></li>\n<li>[rust] Update Rust dependencies by <a href=\"https://github.com/bonigarcia\"><code>@​bonigarcia</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/SeleniumHQ/selenium/pull/18297\">SeleniumHQ/selenium#18297</a></li>\n<li>[py] narrow pytest.raises(Exception) in bidi tests by <a href=\"https://github.com/saiyam-jain-dev\"><code>@​saiyam-jain-dev</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/SeleniumHQ/selenium/pull/18286\">SeleniumHQ/selenium#18286</a></li>\n<li>[java] stop reading and writing Response.status internally by <a href=\"https://github.com/yashp676\"><code>@​yashp676</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/SeleniumHQ/selenium/pull/18171\">SeleniumHQ/selenium#18171</a></li>\n<li>[rust] Restrict Selenium Manager stats to vetted values before sending to Plausible by <a href=\"https://github.com/titusfortner\"><code>@​titusfortner</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/SeleniumHQ/selenium/pull/17892\">SeleniumHQ/selenium#17892</a></li>\n<li>[java] Speed up JSON serialisation and parsing by <a href=\"https://github.com/shs96c\"><code>@​shs96c</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/SeleniumHQ/selenium/pull/17750\">SeleniumHQ/selenium#17750</a></li>\n<li>[py] Fix Select escaping of trailing double quotes by <a href=\"https://github.com/Mohsintl\"><code>@​Mohsintl</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/SeleniumHQ/selenium/pull/18292\">SeleniumHQ/selenium#18292</a></li>\n<li>[java] remove Response.status by <a href=\"https://github.com/yashp676\"><code>@​yashp676</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/SeleniumHQ/selenium/pull/18172\">SeleniumHQ/selenium#18172</a></li>\n<li>[js] Snapshot accessibility in Classic sessions too by <a href=\"https://github.com/AutomatedTester\"><code>@​AutomatedTester</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/SeleniumHQ/selenium/pull/18308\">SeleniumHQ/selenium#18308</a></li>\n<li>[py] Snapshot accessibility in Classic sessions too by <a href=\"https://github.com/AutomatedTester\"><code>@​AutomatedTester</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/SeleniumHQ/selenium/pull/18307\">SeleniumHQ/selenium#18307</a></li>\n<li>[java] publish auto-service-annotations again so -Xlint builds pass by <a href=\"https://github.com/diemol\"><code>@​diemol</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/SeleniumHQ/selenium/pull/18313\">SeleniumHQ/selenium#18313</a></li>\n<li>[py] Find Select options by value with XPath by <a href=\"https://github.com/Mohsintl\"><code>@​Mohsintl</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/SeleniumHQ/selenium/pull/18305\">SeleniumHQ/selenium#18305</a></li>\n<li>[py] Fix accessibility snapshot tests on Safari by <a href=\"https://github.com/AutomatedTester\"><code>@​AutomatedTester</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/SeleniumHQ/selenium/pull/18317\">SeleniumHQ/selenium#18317</a></li>\n<li>[java][bidi] type vendor-declared BiDi fields instead of dropping the… by <a href=\"https://github.com/yashp676\"><code>@​yashp676</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/SeleniumHQ/selenium/pull/18233\">SeleniumHQ/selenium#18233</a></li>\n<li>[java][bidi] Generate listExtensions and add tests by <a href=\"https://github.com/pujagani\"><code>@​pujagani</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/SeleniumHQ/selenium/pull/18322\">SeleniumHQ/selenium#18322</a></li>\n</ul>\n<!-- raw HTML omitted -->\n</blockquote>\n<p>... (truncated)</p>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/SeleniumHQ/selenium/commit/05015309ae5a7496b80e496f540d2ecf969532c7\"><code>0501530</code></a> Release selenium-4.53.0 (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/SeleniumHQ/Selenium/issues/18329\">#18329</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/SeleniumHQ/selenium/commit/720999eed46d6e779168b7e0a320d8aa6c018bb5\"><code>720999e</code></a> [java][rb][dotnet] Remove the accessibility snapshot client implementations (...</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/SeleniumHQ/selenium/commit/a14afd843da0e9f54b60caa609a48562aab2de42\"><code>a14afd8</code></a> [build] Automated Selenium Manager Update</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/SeleniumHQ/selenium/commit/0d98700f63da3593eda1bd5dc584f852256e8a74\"><code>0d98700</code></a> [rust] Update Selenium Manager dependencies (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/SeleniumHQ/Selenium/issues/18328\">#18328</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/SeleniumHQ/selenium/commit/6fe06865dd402879dcdcbd8d4f71244003d540ec\"><code>6fe0686</code></a> [build] Automated Browser Version Update (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/SeleniumHQ/Selenium/issues/18325\">#18325</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/SeleniumHQ/selenium/commit/7b240f5e58db8d1b7fe820bac549140d62250927\"><code>7b240f5</code></a> [py] Use tmp_path for driver service log files</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/SeleniumHQ/selenium/commit/d00a77b1050f5c45199ce2cd8c8e31fb37b5f2fe\"><code>d00a77b</code></a> [build] check packaging before RBE tests so the test summary ends the log</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/SeleniumHQ/selenium/commit/5213c7a995348e19855c51164c459cdcb0d9feed\"><code>5213c7a</code></a> [java] Wait for the second upload submit in FormHandlingTest</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/SeleniumHQ/selenium/commit/3aaf4ec3aaeeed9a0ca525218e394f5434254177\"><code>3aaf4ec</code></a> [build] authenticate update script GitHub API calls with GITHUB_TOKEN</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/SeleniumHQ/selenium/commit/c1f6deec1ea5cf69561f4e29f92589cfdbf5ddee\"><code>c1f6dee</code></a> [java][bidi] Generate listExtensions and add tests (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/SeleniumHQ/Selenium/issues/18322\">#18322</a>)</li>\n<li>Additional commits viewable in <a href=\"https://github.com/SeleniumHQ/Selenium/compare/selenium-4.15.0...selenium-4.53.0\">compare view</a></li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n<br />\n",
